This package contains ReadOS-authored stateless orchestration over the neutral
msp-kernel, msp-command-pack, and msp-backend contracts. It contains no raw MSP
source and does not depend on managed code, process APIs, environment APIs, a
host filesystem, PATH resolution, or a product service.

